        "title": {
          "en": "Microsoft Develops AI System for Space Weather Power Grid Forecasting",
          "zh": "微软开发人工智能系统预测空间天气对电网影响"
        },
        "tl_dr": {
          "en": "Microsoft Research has developed a new machine learning system capable of predicting where space weather damage to power systems is likely to occur 30-60 minutes before a storm.",
          "zh": "微软研究院开发了一种新的机器学习系统，能够在空间天气风暴到来前30-60分钟预测电网系统可能受损的区域。"
        },
        "key_takeaways": {
          "en": [
            "The system utilizes machine learning technology for predictions.",
            "It identifies probable damage locations on power systems.",
            "Predictions are available 30-60 minutes prior to a storm's arrival."
          ],
          "zh": [
            "该系统采用机器学习技术进行预测。",
            "它能够识别电网系统可能发生损坏的区域。",
            "预测可在风暴抵达前30-60分钟提供。"
          ]
        },
        "impact": {
          "en": "This development demonstrates AI's practical application in enhancing the resilience of critical infrastructure by providing actionable forecasts for space weather events. It enables proactive measures to mitigate potential damage to power systems.",
          "zh": "这项进展展示了人工智能在通过提供空间天气事件的可操作预测来增强关键基础设施韧性方面的实际应用。它有助于采取主动措施以减轻对电网系统的潜在损害。"
        },
        "source": "Microsoft Research",
        "link": "https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/research/blog/forecasting-space-weather-risks-on-power-grids/"
      },
      {
        "title": {
