        "tl_dr": {
          "en": "Google DeepMind has introduced a proof of concept for watermarking AI-generated proteins while preserving their biological function.",
          "zh": "谷歌DeepMind推出了一项概念验证，旨在对AI生成的蛋白质进行数字水印处理，同时保留其生物学功能。"
        },
        "key_takeaways": {
          "en": [
            "The initiative is currently a proof of concept.",
            "It focuses on applying watermarks to proteins generated by AI systems.",
            "A core objective is to ensure the preservation of the proteins' biological function during the watermarking process."
          ],
          "zh": [
            "该举措目前处于概念验证阶段。",
            "其重点在于对AI系统生成的蛋白质施加数字水印。",
            "一个核心目标是在水印过程中确保蛋白质生物学功能的保留。"
          ]
        },
        "impact": {
          "en": "This development could offer a method for identifying the origin of AI-generated biological materials, potentially enabling traceability and verifying authenticity in advanced biotechnological applications.",
          "zh": "这一进展可能为识别AI生成生物材料的来源提供一种方法，从而可能在先进生物技术应用中实现可追溯性并验证真实性。"
        },
        "source": "Google DeepMind",
        "link": "https://deepmind.google/blog/introducing-synthid-bio/"
