        },
        "key_takeaways": {
          "en": [
            "Cloudflare announced Clef, a set of open-weight AI models.",
            "These models are designed to choose between predefined options, not generate text.",
            "Cloudflare released two models with 9 billion and 27 billion parameters."
          ],
          "zh": [
            "Cloudflare 发布了 Clef，一套开源权重 AI 模型。",
            "这些模型专为在预定义选项之间做出选择而设计，而非生成文本。",
            "Cloudflare 发布了 90 亿和 270 亿参数两种规模的模型。"
          ]
        },
        "impact": {
